  "notes": "いらっしゃる is an honorific ({尊敬語|そんけいご}) verb that elevates the status of the subject. It replaces いる, {来|く}る, and {行|い}く when speaking respectfully about someone.\n\nCONJUGATION:\n- いらっしゃいます (polite)\n- いらっしゃって (te-form)\n- いらっしゃった (past)\n\nKEIGO TYPE:\n- {尊敬語|そんけいご}: Honorific language elevating the listener/subject",
